{"id":"comportamiento","lemma":"comportamiento","pos":"noun","rank":1604,"glosses":["behavior"],"ipa":"/kompoɾtaˈmjento/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"comportamientos"},"order":1657,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-comportamiento.wav","examples":[{"text":"No me gusta tu comportamiento.","en":"I don't like your behavior.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/587317","words":[{"g":"no / not"},null,null,{"g":"your"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"like, thumbs up"]]},{"text":"El comportamiento del hombre era muy extraño.","en":"The man's behavior was very odd.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/684267","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"man"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"strange"}]},{"text":"No hay excusa para su comportamiento.","en":"There's no excuse for his behavior.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/688911","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"excuse, cop-out"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]}]}